  Agent Role Templates
  Create and inspect role profiles used by spawn_agent.agent_type.
  User templates live in $CODEX_HOME/agents/*.toml.

› 1. Create new template   Creates a valid starter file under $CODEX_HOME/agents/. New sessions
                           load user roles from that native config directory.
  2. [user] code-reviewer  Review code changes before handoff.
  3. [built-in] default    Default agent.
  4. [built-in] explorer   Use `explorer` for specific codebase questions.
  5. [built-in] worker     Use for execution and production work.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
